{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25946a07b4253abe5cfb6bc19c2222187c3e8fa0bfab089e3f37fee76817bb0f",
      "text": "出演古典剧舞台的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d122e2450ed7c2dfd0e1736372e6efa328d4547587b8952718d2557e0a574df",
      "text": "终于要正式开演了吗。大家会给出怎样的\n反应，我期待得不得了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd15d970b588e95d1fcb17d4393fc676f20e4dff2b233b7206c6ab622943a87a",
      "text": "这部舞台的原作，是在一百多年前创作的吧？\n到现在都还这么有人气，真的很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2534bc454891fd44141e4f2aa664dc587ce1eaf198bd69439d6b60224b5f8b0a",
      "text": "我也想成为那种无论过了多少年、几十年，\n都一直被人传颂的偶像啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c47fd338368c2a9fae1bfed3ab00c464497e7f70be34bf7f454b276a0a8bcfb1",
      "text": "冬马先生的话一定能成为那样的偶像的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495abf04e127662e35617da545c5a0f3674fd20e8ee923efffad8e0bf73f390f",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢。所以这次的这个角色，\n我也想给大家留下深刻印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ee2c8187ecff6df832ca9fce5905a60f042fefb6dba29214bc5ec276ad68c5b",
      "text": "不，不止是这个角色。我想让我所做的\n一切，都留在大家的记忆里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f38dba5719692e4f527bc5c06fe499189f0c6c2f519590d4f47c969120b75ee4",
      "text": "我想成为那样的偶像……\n绝对要成为！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:443057e433cbd1f7d083654d66e9a8747b00b1a346de19ae369ba6c9ed6b6070",
      "text": "所以，以后也好好期待着我吧！\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那当然了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_02:1_5_001_02:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb6ce7a73f499fd41377e364319ee18e6f5ce598c22326d1ad15cd879969d0d2",
      "text": "好！\n那我这就去换衣服准备了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
